{"3037930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "[Bober Bros] The Hole", "steam_appid": 3037930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037930/extras/f7f25318d1f5a14c6c809dad261b06a4.poster.avif?t=1739027007\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037930/extras/f7f25318d1f5a14c6c809dad261b06a4.webm?t=1739027007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037930/extras/f7f25318d1f5a14c6c809dad261b06a4.mp4?t=1739027007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍺 <strong>Daily Routine Disrupted:</strong> Relaxing with a beer, watching TV, and trying to unwind — until the noise from next door and mysterious holes in your walls make rest impossible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Short but Unsettling:</strong> Experience a thought-provoking and intense narrative in a 40-minute playthrough, ideal for players seeking a deep yet concise psychological horror experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕹 Retro PS2-Inspired Graphics:</strong> Relive the charm of early 2000s horror games with visuals designed to evoke the nostalgic aesthetic of the PS2 era. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Unique Setting:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world deeply rooted in Interslavic culture, with all text and fully voiced dialogue presented in the Interslavic language, providing a rich and authentic experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> No cheap jumpscares here. The Hole creates tension through